  "id": "blackberry-jam-spice-cake",
  "name": "Blackberry Jam Spice Cake",
  "subtitle": "A warmly spiced cake layered with blackberry jam and finished with dulce de leche frosting.",
  "description": "This tender buttermilk cake combines blackberry jam, aromatic spices, walnuts, and golden raisins under a smooth dulce de leche frosting.",
  "meal_type": "dessert",
